# Static site layout

- `index.html` — copy and structure only (header, mounts, timeline, footer).
- `css/site.css` — theme tokens, layout, map/SVG presentation styles.
- `js/site.js` — theme switcher (`data-theme` + `localStorage`), fetch `[data-map]` SVGs, stroke draw lengths, node tooltips.
- Theme tokens already support light/dark via `:root` / `data-theme` / `prefers-color-scheme`. Keep the small head script that restores `localStorage` theme before paint.
- `maps/*.svg` — geography (`routes.svg`, `wuyue.svg`); keep dense path `d` attributes compact.

## Maps

- Mount points use `data-map="maps/....svg"`; the script injects SVG so `.node` / `.inode` tooltips work.
- Do not switch maps to `<img>` — that breaks tooltip DOM access.
- Serve over HTTP (`npx serve .` / Vercel). `file://` cannot fetch maps or relative assets.
